WEBVTT

00:01:26.516 --> 00:01:30.316
So when I'm close to these elements,
I really feel like home-home;

00:01:30.356 --> 00:01:31.756
I feel connected.

00:01:32.996 --> 00:01:35.836
Now, picture that the place you love,

00:01:35.876 --> 00:01:39.076
that sacred place where
you can feel more at ease

00:01:39.076 --> 00:01:41.876
and sometimes maybe find peace

00:01:41.876 --> 00:01:43.876
is in some way broken

00:01:43.916 --> 00:01:46.036
or even worse -- gone.

00:01:46.796 --> 00:01:50.676
What if this place -- for example,
your favorite bay to swim in --

00:01:50.716 --> 00:01:52.996
which has always been there for you

00:01:53.036 --> 00:01:54.596
now is polluted,

00:01:54.636 --> 00:01:55.836
full of oil,

00:01:55.876 --> 00:01:57.556
dead birds everywhere.

00:01:58.476 --> 00:02:03.876
Or the steady mountain, now hijacked by
big machines and greedy industry.